==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
-

==='''Chapter 2'''===
The Sir Seals at the beginning can be killed with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] for a ton of money, and you can quickly stack a few [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]] and use Roe to defend them. Zigges are easily handled by [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]]. With this you can saw straight through Bore and destroy the base before Dread Bore even spawns.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Arguably one of the easiest stages thanks to only having the Zombie trait and no gimmicky enemies. Simply bring your typical anti-Zombie such as [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] and Holy Blast, as well as any anti-Zombie Ubers you may have. [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] can be an excellent choice to nuke Dread Bore.

